1.Sliding window : 

Aspect	Fixed Window	Variable Window
Window size	Constant (k)	Changes
Shrink condition	When size == k	When condition breaks
Use case	“Size k”	“Longest / shortest”
Loop	Single for	for + while


Fixed window:

int n = arr.length;
int k = 3;

int left = 0;
int windowSum = 0;
int maxSum = Integer.MIN_VALUE;

for (int right = 0; right < n; right++) {

    // expand window
    windowSum += arr[right];

    // once window size hits k
    if (right - left + 1 == k) {
        maxSum = Math.max(maxSum, windowSum);

        // shrink window
        windowSum -= arr[left];
        left++;
    }
}

Dynamic window:

